        <activityName xml:lang="en">Points of presence, network equipment</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Points of presence, network equipment
The data set represents the production of PoPs for data centers; UUID: 7b491b1a-6e40-38f8-8aa8-ff8eadd5b398
The dataset for points of presence (PoP) consists of router, network access device, and chassis. The total weight found for an average PoP is 1.41 kg. The dataset is normalized to 1 kg of PoP mass.
Location: Data for global average for PoPs
Technology: Typical PoPs for data centers
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7b491b1a-6e40-38f8-8aa8-ff8eadd5b398.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
